      "content": "but that's what people say to make themselves feel better. it doesn't change the reality. if i'm gone, the debt is easier to manage, the stress levels drop, and they can actually use that money for something useful instead of just trying to keep me afloat. it's like... if you have a leak in a boat, you don't keep adding more wood to plug it, you just remove the source of the problem. doesn't it make more sense to just stop the bleeding?",
